es them, and the desktop entry Execs an absolute path, so it works even when ~/.local/bin is not on PATH — which is the case this machine is in. | Suite: 897 passed / 0 failed / 0 errors / 0 skipped (this tree); 896 passed / 1 skipped / 0 failed / 0 errors (pristine tree with the fix). tests/test_review_fixes_scripts.py + tests/test_manage_install.py: 39 passed. Nothing pushed.

